  "pr_number": 13403,
  "issue_number": 13058,
  "issue_title": "Inline private modifier of delegate should be ok (instead => Style/AccessModifierDeclarations)",
  "issue_body": "Inline private modifier of `delegate` is necessary for the resulting method to actually be private. But rubocop \r\ncomplains with [Correctable] Style/AccessModifierDeclarations: private should not be inlined in method definitions.\r\n\r\nConsider the following code:\r\n\r\n```ruby\r\n# person.rb\r\n\r\n# frozen_string_literal: true\r\n\r\nclass Person\r\n  def initialize(firstname:)\r\n    @firstname = firstname\r\n  end\r\n\r\n  attr_reader :firstname\r\nend\r\n\r\n# greeter.rb\r\n\r\n# frozen_string_literal: true\r\n\r\nclass Greeter\r\n  def initialize(person:)\r\n    @person = person\r\n  end\r\n\r\n  def call\r\n    \"Hello, #{firstname}!\"\r\n  end\r\n\r\n  private\r\n\r\n  attr_reader :person\r\n  private(*delegate(:firstname, to: :person))\r\nend\r\n```\r\nwe get the following behavior\r\n```ruby\r\n[1] pry(main)> ann = Person.new(firstname: 'Ann')\r\n=> #<Person:0x00007f5f550e9e60 @firstname=\"Ann\">\r\n[2] pry(main)> greeter = Greeter.new(person: ann)\r\n=> #<Greeter:0x00007f5f564299d0 @person=#<Person:0x00007f5f550e9e60 @firstname=\"Ann\">>\r\n[3] pry(main)> greeter.call\r\n=> \"Hello, Ann!\"\r\n[4] pry(main)> greeter.firstname\r\nNoMethodError: private method `firstname' called for an instance of Greeter\r\nfrom (pry):4:in `__pry__'\r\n```\r\nwhich is the desired behavior.\r\n\r\nIf we make the suggested change with\r\n\r\n```ruby\r\nclass Greeter\r\n  def initialize(person:)\r\n    @person = person\r\n  end\r\n\r\n  def call\r\n    \"Hello, #{firstname}!\"\r\n  end\r\n\r\n  private\r\n\r\n  attr_reader :person\r\n  delegate(:firstname, to: :person)\r\nend\r\n```\r\nthe firstname method can be accessed which is not the intention.\r\n\r\n## Expected behavior\r\n\r\nRubocop should not raise a Style/AccessModifierDeclarations for inline private modifier of delegation using delegate and autocorrection should not alter the inline privacy modifier.\r\n\r\n## Actual behavior\r\n\r\nRubocop raises a Style/AccessModifierDeclarations violation and -a autocorrection will remove the private modifier in a way that does not preserve the privacy of the resulting method.\r\n\r\nSee below for the full output\r\n\r\n## Steps to reproduce the problem\r\n\r\nSee code above for a functional example, as for my configuration:\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\nrequire:\r\n  - rubocop-capybara\r\n  - rubocop-minitest\r\n  - rubocop-performance\r\n  - rubocop-rails\r\n\r\nAllCops:\r\n  TargetRubyVersion: 3.3\r\n  TargetRailsVersion: 7.1\r\n  NewCops: enable\r\n```\r\n\r\n## RuboCop version\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ [bundle exec] rubocop -V\r\n1.65.0 (using Parser 3.3.4.0, rubocop-ast 1.31.3, running on ruby 3.3.4) [x86_64-linux]\r\n  - rubocop-capybara 2.21.0\r\n  - rubocop-minitest 0.35.1\r\n  - rubocop-performance 1.21.1\r\n  - rubocop-rails 2.25.1\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Full output\r\n\r\n```\r\nroot@ab222e695eb2:/some_app# be rubocop app/poros/greeter.rb --debug\r\nFor /some_app: configuration from /some_app/.rubocop.yml\r\nconfiguration from /usr/local/bundle/gems/rubocop-capybara-2.21.0/config/default.yml\r\nDefault configuration from /usr/local/bundle/gems/rubocop-1.65.0/config/default.yml\r\nconfiguration from /usr/local/bundle/gems/rubocop-capybara-2.21.0/lib/../config/default.yml\r\nconfiguration from /usr/local/bundle/gems/rubocop-minitest-0.35.1/config/default.yml\r\nconfiguration from /usr/local/bundle/gems/rubocop-minitest-0.35.1/config/default.yml\r\nconfiguration from /usr/local/bundle/gems/rubocop-performance-1.21.1/config/default.yml\r\nconfiguration from /usr/local/bundle/gems/rubocop-performance-1.21.1/config/default.yml\r\nconfiguration from /usr/local/bundle/gems/rubocop-rails-2.25.1/config/default.yml\r\nconfiguration from /usr/local/bundle/gems/rubocop-rails-2.25.1/config/default.yml\r\nUse parallel by default.\r\nSkipping parallel inspection: only a single file needs inspection\r\nInspecting 1 file\r\nScanning /some_app/app/poros/greeter.rb\r\nLoading cache from /root/.cache/rubocop_cache/bf1b41c785ed7c21e82cef7ae46ec2c3de7e00d7/9741b73e32a55fa25bfd0632cfcd5496c34a0c79/9ac823e6c338faf8d6d0a914f7282a9aed8e102b\r\nC\r\n\r\nOffenses:\r\n\r\napp/poros/greeter.rb:15:3: C: [Correctable] Style/AccessModifierDeclarations: private should not be inlined in method definitions.\r\n  private(*delegate(:firstname, to: :person))\r\n  ^^^^^^^\r\n\r\n1 file inspected, 1 offense detected, 1 offense autocorrectable\r\nFinished in 0.455986370001483 seconds\r\n\r\n```\r\n",
